; error: 19:10: 'value 1' is given the place itself, to change, so it can't be an item of a slice, which moves when the slice grows; give the slice and the item's index, or copy the item into a 'flex' variable, change it, and put it back
; A call of a task value gives no item of a slice as a place, as a named call doesn't.
task bump(flex& n: int)
    n = n + 1
fi

task both(flex& a: int, fixed& b: int)
    a = b
fi

task squares(r: region, n: int) -> [int]@r
    <- new [int]() at r
fi

task main()
    region r
    flex xs = [1, 2, ...] at r
    fixed f = bump
    f(&xs[0])
fi
